  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together lime juice and al pastor seasoning.",
    "Add sliced Wagyu beef to the bowl and marinate for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Grill Wagyu beef for 3-4 minutes per side, or until cooked to desired level of doneness.",
    "Meanwhile, grill sliced yellow onions for 2-3 minutes per side, or until caramelized.",
    "Warm tacos on the grill by wrapping them in foil and heating for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Assemble tacos by placing a piece of Wagyu beef onto a warmed tortilla, followed by a spoonful of grilled onions, pineapple, and cilantro.",
    "Drizzle with lime juice and sprinkle with salt to taste.",
